{"at": "2026-09-22T18:01:40.558187+00:00", "event_id": "01M354FNEE0X4RA0J3GW63MM0N", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M354BCPEAH6CPXGSHMY0B9XJ", "final_answer": "Hybrid per-flow: refuse + require --force where the user drives the command directly and a flag is natural (intake brief); back up the existing foreign file to a timestamped sidecar + warn + proceed where refusing would break an in-progress workflow (git-hook install during implement \u2014 detect a foreign hook by signature, back it up, and surface it in output). Removals remain preserve-in-place + warn via the existing guard.", "mission_id": "01M3549Q1JZYMX2V648F15ACZY", "mission_slug": "user-content-preservation-01M3549Q", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-09-22T18:01:40.558187Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M354BCPEAH6CPXGSHMY0B9XJ", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-22T18:01:40.549612Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-09-22T18:01:48.644200+00:00", "event_id": "01M354FXB44CQCW5H1KDZ4A1QC", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M354BMVXECKWX0M1FT3XE27P", "final_answer": "One non-draft PR to upstream for all 7 defects + the census-closure gate. Single issue-matrix and acceptance gate; WPs land as sliced commits with the two P0 fixes ordered first.", "mission_id": "01M3549Q1JZYMX2V648F15ACZY", "mission_slug": "user-content-preservation-01M3549Q", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-09-22T18:01:48.644200Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M354BMVXECKWX0M1FT3XE27P", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-22T18:01:48.636707Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
